      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Cache key embeds YEAR_MONTH plus a hash of pnpm-lock.yaml so the store cache is naturally evicted every month instead of growing unbounded; restore-keys fall back to the same month's prefix. HUSKY=0 is set during install so git hooks never run on CI runners. Pattern adopted from the belgattitude gist."
